      },
      "message": "fix(release): preflight checks RELEASE_NOTES.md as release.yml publishes it\n\nrelease.yml's publish job takes this version's notes as everything\nbefore RELEASE_NOTES.md's first '---' line. release.ps1 never checked\nthat, so v0.14.0's notes (its own section only, no separator) passed\nthe cut, the tag went out, and only the publish job refused them.\nPhase 1 now applies the publish step's checks - a '---' line, a\nnon-empty section before it, a first line naming -Version - and fails\nbefore the bump.\n\nChecked against main's notes (0.14.0 passes, 0.15.0 refused by name)\nand the v0.14.0 tag's notes (refused: no '---').\n\nFixes #272\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
